        "category": "class",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have an overclocked tech minion.</p><hr /><p>You channel energy from your overclocked tech minion into your spell database. If your next action is to Cast a Spell, you siphon surplus magical energy to cause your overclocked minion to @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.actions.Item.Stride] and erupt in a burst of flames and lightning after the spell resolves. It deals @Damage[(3 + floor((@actor.level - 10) / 2))d4[fire]|options:area-damage] fire damage and @Damage[(3 + floor((@actor.level - 10) / 2))d4[electricity]|options:area-damage] electricity damage in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:10] (@Check[reflex|against:class-spell|basic|options:area-effect] save against your spell DC) and is destroyed. At 12th level and every two levels thereafter, increase the fire and electricity damage you deal by 1d4.</p>"
